      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "6. Spirited men, devoted to the performance of the vow",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "of truthfulness, sacrifice their lives willingly but not their",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "vow which is the source of modesty and numerous other",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "good qualities, which keeps the heart exceedingly pure and",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "is binding like a mother of exceedingly pure heart and",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
